#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""
Headless AmneziaVPN AWG2/AWG3 sharing and client management for an Amnezia VPS.

Compatibility target: official amnezia-vpn/amnezia-client self-hosted format.
- AWG2/AWG3 container: amnezia-awg2
- server config: /opt/amnezia/awg/awg0.conf
- clients table: /opt/amnezia/awg/clientsTable
- client IDs: WireGuard/AWG public keys
- Amnezia multi-QR framing: qint16 magic=1984, uint8 count, uint8 index,
  QDataStream QByteArray (uint32 length + bytes), Base64URL, QR ECC L
- payload compression: Qt qCompress-compatible (uint32 BE original size + zlib)

Only Python stdlib is required. Runtime dependencies on the VPS:
  docker, qrencode, ip, curl; Full Access also requires ssh-keygen
"""

